			"notes": "**Project icon**: the letter \"C\" now darker\n**Female mob variants**: now little bit smaller than the male variants\n**Bug fixes**: You can no longer get an unlimited amount of pumpkin seeds by right-clicking a pumpkin with shears\n(this bug has existed because the mod replaces carved pumpkins with uncarved ones, and right-clicking with shears was not blocked)\n**Minecraft version**: was added support for version 26.3\n**Other technical details**: **Fabric Loader** was updated to `0.19.5`, **Fabric API** was updated to `0.160.6+26.3` (for 26.2 it's `0.160.0+26.2`)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AnecFox/cleanedcraft/compare/v1.1.2...v1.1.3"
